## F16 — P2: Transport fuzzers never reach response decoding

internal/hostedbrain/client_fuzz_test.go:74 and internal/factsync/wire_fuzz_test.go:76,108 use http://fuzz.invalid. apiurl.Validate rejects this non-loopback HTTP URL before the custom in-memory transport runs. The harnesses discard errors, so all seeds pass without exercising their claimed decoder paths. Use an accepted HTTPS test origin and assert a valid seed reaches the transport/decoder. Hosted reproduction in audit-hosted-repro.log confirms the early refusal; factsync shares the same validation boundary. Related stale tests in client_repoid_escape_test.go skip when validation prevents egress and mislabel that as an environment limitation; update expectations to the actual reject contract.

